---
import catalog from '../../../data/martin/index.mjs';

const appendix = catalog.parts[6].units[2];
---

<nav class="appendix-contents" aria-labelledby="appendix-c-contents-title">
  <h2 id="appendix-c-contents-title">附录目录 | Appendix contents</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><a href="#reference-orientation">使用定位 | Reference orientation</a></li>
    <li><a href="#source-map">来源地图 | Source map</a></li>
    <li><a href="#objects-and-conventions">对象、单位与约定 | Objects, units, and conventions</a></li>
    <li><a href="#section-c-1">C.1 一般表述 | General formulation</a></li>
    <li><a href="#coupled-equations">耦合方程与导数耦合 | Coupled equations and derivative couplings</a></li>
    <li><a href="#adiabatic-equation">绝热核方程与对角修正 | Adiabatic nuclear equation and diagonal correction</a></li>
    <li><a href="#breakdown">简并、近简并与失效条件 | Degeneracy and breakdown</a></li>
    <li><a href="#section-c-2">C.2 电子—声子相互作用 | Electron-phonon interactions</a></li>
    <li><a href="#cross-references">正文交叉引用 | Chapter cross-references</a></li>
    <li><a href="#review">误判、练习与来源边界 | Review and sources</a></li>
  </ol>
</nav>

<section id="source-map" class="chapter-source-map" aria-labelledby="appendix-c-source-title">
  <h2 id="appendix-c-source-title">来源地图 | Source map</h2>
  <p>
    下表记录 Martin Appendix C 的目录标题和印刷页定位。网站正文、补充推导、图形和练习均为原创，不转录教材正文、原图或习题。
  </p>
  <p lang="en">
    The table records Martin Appendix C directory titles and printed-page locators. Website prose, supplemental derivations, diagrams, and exercises are original and do not reproduce textbook prose, figures, or exercises.
  </p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>原书位置 | Source locator</th>
        <th>原节标题 | Source section</th>
        <th>网站覆盖 | Website coverage</th>
        <th>状态 | State</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {appendix.sections.map((section) => (
        <tr>
          <td>{section.id}, printed p. {section.page}</td>
          <td>{section.title}</td>
          <td>
            {section.id === 'C.1'
              ? '电子态参数化、Born–Huang 展开、导数耦合、绝热核方程、对角修正与失效条件'
              : '非绝热跃迁、核速度/声子算符、势导数矩阵元与能量分母'}
          </td>
          <td>source mapped; substantive drafting</td>
        </tr>
      ))}
      <tr>
        <td>Exercises, printed p. {appendix.exercisesPage}</td>
        <td>Source exercises not reproduced</td>
        <td>原创推导、极限和数值实验 | Original derivation, limit, and numerical exercises</td>
        <td>original replacement planned</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</section>

<style>
  .appendix-contents {
    margin-block: 1.5rem 2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
    border-radius: 0.65rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-gray-7);
  }

  .appendix-contents h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .appendix-contents ol {
    columns: 2;
    column-gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .appendix-contents li {
    break-inside: avoid;
    margin-block: 0.35rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 50rem) {
    .appendix-contents ol {
      columns: 1;
    }
  }
</style>
